    "description": "Closed Mentalism 3.9 - Speed. Spells for tireless running/swimming/sprinting and boosting the caster's own activity rate (the Speed and Haste families), plus rapid reading. Special Notes: Only one Haste or Speed spell may be in effect on an individual at any given time. In addition, Speed requires a 50% activity penalty after the spell effects end; casting a Speed or Haste spell at that point will only bring a person to normal activity, rather than extending the 200% activity time (50% x 2 = 100%).",
